# The High Pasture: by minecart, up above the valley. Wild herbs and flowers, an old paddock, and a herd that
# keeps its distance. Leave hay in the trough three days running and one of them follows you home (areas.c).
map PASTURE set=FARM w=24 h=14 music=SPRING
key # FOREST block
key P PINE block
key B BIRCH block
key b BUSH block
key . GRASS walk
key , GRASS2 walk
key * WILDFLOWER walk
key = PATH walk
key h FENCE_H block
key v FENCE_V block
key q FENCE_POST block
key t TROUGH block
key y HAY_BALE block
key x MINE_CRATE block
grid
